                <l xml:id="m-62d5fd53-7400-4a51-8d3c-4d375930b3af" facs="#m-6090a829-2531-4e60-824c-930261a4fea2" label="text-like">whit Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-bb4b8a87-f426-45d1-ac77-2bc07a83fba5" facs="#m-6df4b304-473e-4d33-8d2b-ef0878154c06" label="ambiguous">ses</l><l xml:id="m-273d7e44-48f3-4ac7-b3e1-d6f578b38094" facs="#m-48f38b66-21f1-43e9-892c-58430834c520" label="ambiguous">ri-a,</l><l xml:id="m-2e11965d-f03b-4b8b-a273-bf26087c7e56" facs="#m-19fffe85-935b-4801-a3a4-56fe0d4fb079" label="lyrics-like">Et Fí-li-o, qui a mórtu-is Surréxit, ac Pa-rá¬</l><l xml:id="m-1e6a880c-d3cf-4fd4-86a6-b13e5d98bc99" facs="#m-4dbe186a-7c90-4bf7-8117-bc56fdfeb705" label="lyrics-like">cli-to, In saecu-ló-rum saécu-la. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-dc0b6570-371b-496c-a083-714ec53c4102" facs="#m-93c3b9d8-d67c-4644-a757-636c27bf0a28" label="text-like">IN THE NOCTURN.</l><l xml:id="m-3c49864c-9aaf-4a8c-b179-6f530fc2346a" facs="#m-13b5ff4c-106a-4b85-bdf9-009b6b05ab76" label="ambiguous">1. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-bb6a879a-07eb-4455-8cc0-6a17ccb99354" facs="#m-d2a4f5a7-3b78-4bca-9483-b86c0df6d05a" label="ambiguous">8. e</l><l xml:id="m-89a30958-ac89-4913-b343-54fe93e8fe96" facs="#m-fd40fe00-a9b3-4a6c-98f8-d375ce9d4e82" label="lyrics-like">Actus est repénte de caélo só-nus</l><l xml:id="m-0c3a847f-ecfd-480c-bbe0-ed4a2414782f" facs="#m-0263cf13-cf9a-4153-8ddb-6257f0120291" label="lyrics-like">adveni-éntis</l><l xml:id="m-28d7bc3a-9aed-432b-936c-81bdb609957b" facs="#m-d7be16c7-eec2-4193-b461-f68c95c31309" label="lyrics-like">spí-ri-tus veheméntis, alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-757cb99a-54e0-4fc4-8c10-7d164fe566df" facs="#m-9e97df82-f7e5-4a48-bbf5-afe81b4098f6" label="ambiguous">Psalm 47.</l><l xml:id="m-deae9c5b-2cde-42b3-bd25-dac54760727c" facs="#m-742b1340-30b1-45f4-881c-44655ad0a141" label="lyrics-like">1. Mágnus Dóminus, et laudábi-lis ni-mis“ in civi-táte Dé-i</l><l xml:id="m-f1ec2598-1ebe-4bcd-8962-5701b8ae290c" facs="#m-f181cfd5-090b-4f87-897f-48dcf98dbaa1" label="lyrics-like">nóstri, in mónte sáncto é¬ jus. Flex: admi rá-ti sunt,</l><l xml:id="m-a2629145-1f4a-4e2f-84ce-c672a4e649b2" facs="#m-322da834-7944-4a1c-9d41-1064ff07b452" label="lyrics-like">2. Fundátur exsultatióne univérsae térrae mons Sion, * látera Aqui¬</l><l xml:id="m-b8bab9b6-5cce-4ccf-8c27-91fea47030b9" facs="#m-617ac57f-137e-421f-a474-9674c2a19ae4" label="lyrics-like">lónis, clvitas régis mágni.</l><l xml:id="m-9f662b46-db6f-4c91-a915-5b209f93fe60" facs="#m-0a1efc42-5ff8-47a5-abe4-37c997e82645" label="lyrics-like">3. Déus in dómibus éjus cognoseétur, * cum suscípiet éam.</l><l xml:id="m-ff9ca530-e19d-4732-9b49-f43b9d8964e3" facs="#m-4e3ec1d8-613f-4e84-af70-f480945d3165" label="lyrics-like">4. Quóniam ecce réges térrae congregáti sunt: convenérant in</l><l xml:id="m-52754945-605e-4413-b47d-e738a52fde23" facs="#m-4b682ea6-d728-42ce-94e0-37db5cfecb9d" label="lyrics-like">únum.</l><l xml:id="m-2d5511cb-2f12-4e25-8a00-16907d025ba4" facs="#m-6af9cf58-bce7-4e2b-b592-8e897e47f2f1" label="lyrics-like">5. Ipsi vidéntes sic admiráti sunt, t conturbáti sunt, commóti sunt:</l><l xml:id="m-030acdf6-dc1d-4ffa-8a96-338194303500" facs="#m-b3416b39-4ff1-42aa-b88f-78073ab78f7e" label="lyrics-like">trémor apprehéndit éos.</l><l xml:id="m-eb0c2ad4-15e1-4c45-9c4f-90dbc97cde22" facs="#m-1aa5fea7-02c5-4b92-bfae-37a10180149e" label="lyrics-like">6. Ibi dolóres ut parturiéntis:*in spiritu veheménti cónteres náves</l><l xml:id="m-13fbef9c-58b3-45cd-98d0-10e1a7a77f74" facs="#m-ec0b1009-8f99-4bce-9185-9976bc410abc" label="lyrics-like">Thársis.</l><l xml:id="m-1dd2f7cf-cdef-4669-9c20-907b1d73dab9" facs="#m-ebb55a78-74a6-401e-a1cd-819f910a11eb" label="lyrics-like">7. Sicut audívimus, sic vidimus in civitá̂te Dómini virtútum, t in</l><l xml:id="m-13be4e77-6329-45b2-ab30-307a1fee8faf" facs="#m-bbf424ed-c8d4-4ea0-a2d8-81790c1428f4" label="lyrics-like">civitáte Déi nostri :* Déus fundávit éam in aetérnum.</l><l xml:id="m-7fcefd41-89a6-441b-9ef8-72f8a6b51b9d" facs="#m-ae9b2805-8c96-462a-96e4-d74c1d8da45e" label="lyrics-like">8. Suscépimus Déus misericórdiam túam, * in médio témpit túi.</l><l xml:id="m-4d917cc5-05f6-4f02-8942-a1a3cadc4ec5" facs="#m-76b5cd59-0331-4e7c-bb05-f99897f86421" label="lyrics-like">9. Secúndum nómen túum Déus, sic et laus túa in fines térrae:</l><l xml:id="m-04d73ab6-caaf-4d2d-a01c-cb0fcc4b2c76" facs="#m-f6a0a011-29de-41b5-811e-103797b5f7be" label="lyrics-like">justítia pléna est déxtera túa.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>